  "title": "GE Vernova Releases Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Today, we released our second quarter 2026 financial results. We delivered strong performance in the quarter, with significant orders and backlog growth, margin expansion, and cash generation. Given our strong first half results and continued momentum, we are increasing our 2026 financial guidance for revenue and free cash flow*. We maintain our adjusted EBITDA margin* rate of 12%-14% which implies increased adjusted EBITDA* based on higher revenue guidance.",
